ind":"update","title":"Demo patch 0.6.6","summary":"Added a guard for a bug that blocks inputs and requires a restart to continue;added an option to attach game logs to a feedback report.If you happen to encounter the aforementioned bug, using the new feedback option should help me resolve it :)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T18:11:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687689","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3165740-1846651706684800","game_id":"steam-3165740","kind":"update","title":"Demo patch 0.6.4 & 0.6.5","summary":"0.6.4Fixed some problems with resolutions when playing in windowed mode;fixed a problem with the map appearing offset;artifact tooltips now correctly display all their information under the name (rarity ecc.).0.6.5Minor updates no longer clear your current run;fixed a bug where Renewal Orb could offer relics that shouldn't appear.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T15:21:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684800","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3165740-1842846814451718","game_id":"steam-3165740","kind":"update","title":"Demo patch 0.6.3","summary":"Scythe and Drill artifacts now reveal cells instead of removing them;Decaying ground now removes 10% of board cells instead of 15%;Gambler class is now unlocked with 8 shop rerolls instead of 10;added a \"None\" option to unbind panning from the mouse buttons;added a dedicated, rebindable button to start panning;fixed prompts showing generic icons instead of the connected controller ones.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T21:58:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https: